Actually the `narrow` predicate: `Predicate.Castable<this["infer"], narrowed>`. A predicate can be `(data) => boolean` or `(data, ctx) => boolean | undefined` where ctx.mustBe sets an error. Let me check the @ark/schema predicate types.

